    include/tam-last/keys.h and src/keys/encode.c: disambiguate (1),
    event types press/repeat/release (2), alternate shifted keys (4),
    all keys as escape codes including modifiers/locks (8), and
    associated text (16). Distinct PUA codes for keypad and modifier
    keys; F3 uses CSI 13 ~ under disambiguate to avoid CPR collision.
  - Wired active screen flags and press/repeat/release events through
    src/main.c.
